		{"id":"platform","type":"text","text":"## Platform administration\n\nSuperadmin: organizations, subscriptions, global users, SaaS configuration, website content and profile.","x":520,"y":480,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"workspace","type":"text","text":"## Organization workspace\n\nAdmin, Agent, Customer and Owner. Saved role permissions determine access; names alone do not.","x":1040,"y":480,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"auth","type":"text","text":"## Authentication and permissions\n\nNextAuth credentials + bcrypt. Session → action permission → tenant/ownership scope. auth.ts; lib/rbac.ts; lib/tenant.ts.","x":1560,"y":480,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"property","type":"text","text":"## Property operations\n\nProperties, units, amenities, agents and owners. Public detail and workspace management are separate surfaces.","x":0,"y":840,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
