		{"id":"stack","type":"text","text":"## Application stack\n\nNext.js App Router + React + TypeScript + Tailwind. API handlers and UI live in System. MongoDB through Mongoose.","x":0,"y":1200,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"integrations","type":"text","text":"## Integrations and AI\n\nSMTP/Nodemailer; Twilio; maps dependency; AI-labelled routes. Configuration and successful external behavior remain unverified.","x":520,"y":1200,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"brain","type":"text","text":"## Separate SaveMAX Brain\n\nSibling lead-research project; interface established on port 4640. Not the System backend. Technical documentation stays here.","x":1040,"y":1200,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
